> gates for x & y for unsigned 2-bit x and unsigned 2-bit y?
  ucas: it(x: u2, y: u2) = x & y
  ucas: gates it
gates for it: 4 input bits -> 2 output bits, basis c
  minimal: cost 2, 2 steps (no program of cost <= 1 exists; 6 candidates searched)
  checked: the program reproduces every output bit on all 16 care inputs
  t0 = and(x0, y0)               = x0 & y0
  t1 = and(x1, y1)               = x1 & y1
  r1 = t1
  r0 = t0
